Setu's sync engine
==================

Setu contains Syncthing's code (https://syncthing.net), version v2.1.7, built into the program
as a library. Syncthing is copyright the Syncthing contributors and is licensed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0; the full text is in LICENSE-MPL-2.0 next to this file.

The source code of Syncthing as used by Setu is available from:
  https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/tree/v2.1.7
Setu uses it unmodified. Setu's own Go code that drives it (engine/go in Setu's repository,
https://github.com/sudharamachandranrajeev/setu-sync-manager) is also MPL-2.0.

Syncthing in turn uses Go modules under their own licences (BSD, MIT, Apache 2.0, MPL 2.0 and
others); the list with versions is engine/go/go.sum in Setu's repository.
